+## 0.1.0
+
+- Add shared, pure-Dart workflows for page operations, text search, ordered
+  merging, image placement, watermarks, typed named form filling, and OCR-span
+  import.
+- Centralize one-based page validation, output warnings, encryption-loss
+  acknowledgment, glyph coverage checks, and byte/page limits for GUI and CLI.
+- Keep persistence, overwrite decisions, rendering, and OCR backend selection
+  in the host application.
